<title>PAKISTAN: Muslim Commercial Bank H1 net up 75 pct.</title>
<headline>Muslim Commercial Bank H1 net up 75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Income		    7,308 vs 5,867</p>
<p>    Expenditure	     6,833 vs 5,595</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 475 vs   272</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	  475 vs   272</p>
<p>    Dividend interim	  nil vs   nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Muslim Commercial Bank Ltd. It was privatised in 1991. There is no book closure date as no dividend has been announced.</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
